DATA ATTRIBUTION

The instance data (A-Box) in this repository is derived from the
public Individual Offender Datafiles published annually by the
U.S. Sentencing Commission, which are in the public domain at source.
Any permitted use of this repository must separately acknowledge the
U.S. Sentencing Commission as the primary source of the underlying
case data:

  U.S. Sentencing Commission (2014-2025). Individual Offender
  Datafiles, FY2014 through FY2025.
  https://www.ussc.gov/research/datafiles/commission-datafiles

The proprietary license above applies to the code, ontology, SHACL
shapes, SKOS vocabularies, analytical outputs, HTML reports, and all
documentation that constitute the derivative work. It does not
restrict any use of the underlying USSC data at its public source.

